                      "content": "Near the limit: a window at 80% or more, or a CLI that says it is warning (Claude Code status allowed_warning; it crossed its own 75% threshold, surpassedThreshold). Emphasis stays grayscale, as everywhere in the app: the item icon becomes circle-alert in $text, and that CLI's name and percentage turn $text, the percentage medium weight. In the hint the full window's meter fill, percentage and reset are $text and the heading says which limit is close: Near the weekly limit. The other CLI stays as in M. Nothing else changes and nothing is blocked; Orchester does not slow or hold runs because of a plan limit.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
