                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Nothing known yet: each CLI shows a dash in $subtle, like every value the app does not know (Counts rule), and the hint says why per CLI. Not read yet: no turn of that CLI since the app started; limits are kept for the session only and are not stored, so every app start begins here. Codex may also answer outside a run through codex app-server; that is not confirmed and not drawn. Not signed in: the connection check (Connections, CLI login) found the CLI signed out; Orchester never signs in or sees tokens, so the hint sends the user to a terminal and to Test connection, and names when the check ran. A CLI without a connection in this project is not listed; a project with no agent connection has no plan limits item at all, as a window without a project has no project items.",
