                      "name": "State note",
                      "fill": "$subtle",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Narrow windows drop, in order: the version, then Tokens today, then the labels of Agents, Queued and Needs you (icon and count stay). The plan limits item stays, because nothing else in the window shows plan limits, while Tokens today is also the Overview metric. At 960 the normal item fits with every label (the activity keeps about 210 px and truncates with an ellipsis); a reached item is wider, so the count labels go too. The item itself never truncates: CLI names and percentages are short and fixed.",
