                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Press on a tab and move 4px to drag it along the strip (horizontal only). The dragged tab lifts: $raised fill, radius 7 on all corners, $text label, the elevation shadow of floating layers. The other tabs slide aside to open the slot where it will land. Release drops it there; Escape or releasing outside the title bar puts it back. Dragging does not activate the tab, and a tab cannot be dragged out into a new window (there is one window). Only the slot, not the dragged tab, keeps a place in the strip.",
