                  "name": "State note",
                  "fill": "$subtle",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The list, names, paths, folder checks and runner states come at once (the application database, the file system and the runners Orchester started). Active runs and Needs you are read from each project’s own database; until a row’s counts are read they show a dash — “not known yet”, never 0. No spinner and no page-level loading state: the page is usable immediately and Open works on every openable row. A project whose database cannot be read shows “Can’t be opened” with the reason, as Atlas does.",
