                      "id": "xs1mv",
                      "name": "State note",
                      "fill": "$muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The status label says where the run stands; the last column says what that means for the task now. A pause that has been requested keeps Running until the agent reaches its checkpoint (Pausing at the next checkpoint). Paused and Interrupted name the checkpoint they continue from. Stopped at limit says what continues it: raising the limit, or the daily budget's next day. Status is 128 wide so Stopped at limit fits; the last column is 184 so its longest text fits on one line.",
