                        "szYuk": {
                          "content": "Builder finishes the command it is running (pnpm test src/auth), then stops. Its changes are committed as a checkpoint and Implement restarts from it with the new permissions. Nothing in the worktree is lost; the agent’s unsaved reasoning since its last turn is not carried over unless the CLI can resume its session."
