                                  "content": "# Run checks\n\nRun these from the repository root, in this order:\n\n1. pnpm lint        fails on any warning\n2. pnpm typecheck\n3. pnpm test\n\nHow to read a failure: reference/reading-test-output.md\nThe order and the flags CI uses: reference/ci-order.txt\n\n## When a check fails\n- Report the exact command and its exit code.\n- Quote the first failing test, not the whole log.\n- Never update a snapshot to make a test pass.",
